.play/

# python
**/__pycache__

# --- Campaigns ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Your campaigns are personal play data. Only the template is part of the tool.
campaigns/*
!campaigns/README.md
!campaigns/_template/

# --- Library -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Tracked: our own files (READMEs, sources.md, house rules, sheet templates, general table rules).
# Not tracked: content drawn from third-party sources (rules text, stat blocks, spells, items,
# character options, creature templates, tables, setting lore). These patterns are written for
# every system and setting folder, not just pf1e/golarion.

# System folders (library/<system>/): content subfolders are local only, except their README
library/*/bestiary/*
library/*/npcs/*
library/*/spells/*
library/*/items/*
library/*/character-options/*
library/*/templates/*
library/*/tables/*
library/*/rules/*
!library/*/*/README.md

# Setting folders (library/settings/<setting>/): lore is local only; README and sources.md are ours
library/settings/*/*
!library/settings/*/README.md
!library/settings/*/sources.md

# library/general/ is entirely our own and always tracked
!library/general/**

# Personal: which published adventures you have played (spoiler handling). Local only;
# player-profile.example.md shows the format.
library/general/player-profile.md
